  "translation": "Last weekend, I went to the park with my friend. There were many flowers in the park, very beautiful. We walked in, first looked at flowers. Then we walked east and saw a lake. There was a bridge on the lake, and to the left of the bridge there was a big tree, with several people resting under the tree. We walked over and saw those fish. My friend asked me: 'Can you eat bread?' I said: 'No, I'm not hungry.' After that we went to the store and bought two cups of water. Outside the store, I met a classmate. He asked me: 'Where are you going?' I said: 'I'm going home.' We took the bus home together. Today we had a lot of fun."
